OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel targeted by
OL,4,Aprotesters to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn asylum hotel that was the target of
OL,7,Fanti-immigration protests is to close.
OL,9,FThe Mercure Hotel in Redcliffe,
OL,10,FBristol, which was at the centre of a
OL,11,Fdemonstration that turned violent in
OL,12,F2024, is going to stop housing asylum
OL,13,Fseekers.
OL,15,FThe government said it wanted to end
OL,16,Fthe use of asylum hotels, with Border
OL,17,FSecurity and Asylum Minister Anna
OL,18,FTurley saying: "We won't stop until
OL,19,Fthey are all shut for good."
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
