OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum hotel targeted by
OL,4,Aprotesters to close
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight hotels around the UK are expected
OL,7,Fto stop housing asylum seekers in
OL,8,FDecember, bringing the total remaining
OL,9,Fopen to just over 140. The BBC has
OL,10,Fapproached Mercure for comment.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
